  "body": "@qsmits - test programs from CamCraft's `heidenhain.cps` (DIN/ISO output) for your iTNC 530 VM (NC software 340490-03). They are the post's committed golden outputs on `main` at `c5f4e6f94`, generated from small test parts, all in mm (G71). Could you load them into your iTNC 530 VM and say whether the control accepts each one (syntax errors, unsupported cycles or words, warnings)? Anything that fails becomes an issue against `heidenhain.cps`.\n\n| File | What it covers |\n|---|---|\n| drill_peck.H | Peck drilling with Cycle 205 (Q-parameter block) |\n| tap_plate.H | Tapping cycle |\n| contour_plate_with_hole.H | 2D contour with arcs (G02/G03, I/J), lead-in/lead-out |\n| pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.H | Pocket clearing around an island, many linear moves |\n\n<details><summary>drill_peck.H (17 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Drill1 - DRILL*\nN30 ; T4 6MM HSS DRILL - DRILL D6*\nN40 T4 G17 S1500*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+6*\nN80 G00 X+20 Y+10*\nN90 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+0*\nN100 G205 Q200=+0 Q201=-24 Q206=+60 Q202=+18 Q203=+0 Q204=+0 Q212=+0 Q205=+18 Q258=+0 Q259=+0 Q257=+18 Q256=+1 Q211=+0 Q379=+0 Q253=+60 Q208=FMAX Q395=+0*\nN110 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+0 M99*\nN120 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+6*\nN130 M9*\nN140 M5*\nN150 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>tap_plate.H (17 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Tap1 - TAP*\nN30 ; T5 M10X1.5 TAP - TAP D10*\nN40 T5 G17 S500*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+5*\nN80 G00 X+15 Y+15*\nN90 G00 X+15 Y+15 Z+0*\nN100 G207 Q200=+0 Q201=-12 Q239=+1.5 Q203=+0 Q204=+0*\nN110 G00 X+15 Y+15 Z+0 M99*\nN120 G00 X+15 Y+15 Z+5*\nN130 M9*\nN140 M5*\nN150 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>contour_plate_with_hole.H (78 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Contour1 - 2D CONTOUR*\nN30 ; T2 6MM 3FL END MILL - FLAT END MILL D6*\nN40 T2 G17 S6000*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+5*\nN80 G00 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z+5*\nN90 G00 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z+2*\nN100 G01 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z-2 F100*\nN110 I+40.519 J-5.975*\nN120 G03 X+40.346 Y-2.98 Z-2 F500*\nN130 G01 X+40 Y-3 Z-2 F500*\nN140 G01 X+0 Y-3 Z-2 F500*\nN150 I+0 J+0*\nN160 G02 X-3 Y+0 Z-2 F500*\nN170 G01 X-3 Y+20 Z-2 F500*\nN180 I+0 J+20*\nN190 G02 X+0 Y+23 Z-2 F500*\nN200 G01 X+40 Y+23 Z-2 F500*\nN210 I+40 J+20*\nN220 G02 X+43 Y+20 Z-2 F500*\nN230 G01 X+43 Y+0 Z-2 F500*\nN240 I+40 J+0*\nN250 G02 X+40.346 Y-2.98 Z-2 F500*\nN260 I+40.691 J-5.96*\nN270 G03 X+37.711 Y-6.306 Z-2 F500*\nN280 G01 X+37.711 Y-6.306 Z+2 F500*\nN290 G00 X+19.25 Y+9.75 Z+2*\nN300 G01 X+19.25 Y+9.75 Z-2 F100*\nN310 I+20 J+9.75*\nN320 G03 X+20 Y+9 Z-2 F500*\nN330 G01 X+21 Y+9 Z-2 F500*\nN340 G01 X+21 Y+11 Z-2 F500*\nN350 G01 X+19 Y+11 Z-2 F500*\nN360 G01 X+19 Y+9 Z-2 F500*\nN370 G01 X+20 Y+9 Z-2 F500*\nN380 I+20 J+9.75*\nN390 G03 X+20.75 Y+9.75 Z-2 F500*\nN400 G00 X+20.75 Y+9.75 Z+5*\nN410 G00 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z+5*\nN420 G00 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z+2*\nN430 G01 X+43.514 Y-5.802 Z-4 F100*\nN440 I+40.519 J-5.975*\nN450 G03 X+40.346 Y-2.98 Z-4 F500*\nN460 G01 X+40 Y-3 Z-4 F500*\nN470 G01 X+0 Y-3 Z-4 F500*\nN480 I+0 J+0*\nN490 G02 X-3 Y+0 Z-4 F500*\nN500 G01 X-3 Y+20 Z-4 F500*\nN510 I+0 J+20*\nN520 G02 X+0 Y+23 Z-4 F500*\nN530 G01 X+40 Y+23 Z-4 F500*\nN540 I+40 J+20*\nN550 G02 X+43 Y+20 Z-4 F500*\nN560 G01 X+43 Y+0 Z-4 F500*\nN570 I+40 J+0*\nN580 G02 X+40.346 Y-2.98 Z-4 F500*\nN590 I+40.691 J-5.96*\nN600 G03 X+37.711 Y-6.306 Z-4 F500*\nN610 G01 X+37.711 Y-6.306 Z+2 F500*\nN620 G00 X+19.25 Y+9.75 Z+2*\nN630 G01 X+19.25 Y+9.75 Z-4 F100*\nN640 I+20 J+9.75*\nN650 G03 X+20 Y+9 Z-4 F500*\nN660 G01 X+21 Y+9 Z-4 F500*\nN670 G01 X+21 Y+11 Z-4 F500*\nN680 G01 X+19 Y+11 Z-4 F500*\nN690 G01 X+19 Y+9 Z-4 F500*\nN700 G01 X+20 Y+9 Z-4 F500*\nN710 I+20 J+9.75*\nN720 G03 X+20.75 Y+9.75 Z-4 F500*\nN730 G00 X+20.75 Y+9.75 Z+5*\nN740 M9*\nN750 M5*\nN760 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n